This directory exists as a Claude Code-facing mirror of the canonical skill
definitions in `.agents/skills/`.

In this repository, `.agents/skills/` is the source of truth. The repository
validator at `.agents/validate-skills.pl` checks that the corresponding
`.claude/skills/` files exist and match exactly.

In short:

- Prefer edits in `.agents/skills/...`.
- Mirror the same changes into `.claude/skills/...`.
- Keep both trees synchronized so validation continues to pass.
